1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,618
Au secours ! Le fromage a disparu !
Help! The cheese has disappeared!

2
00:00:04,918 --> 00:00:07,342
Qui a pris le fromage ?
Who took the cheese?

3
00:00:07,642 --> 00:00:11,074
Je ne sais pas. Regarde ces petites traces !
I don't know. Look at these little tracks!

4
00:00:11,374 --> 00:00:15,526
Des traces de pattes ! Elles vont par là !
Paw prints! They go that way!

5
00:00:15,826 --> 00:00:21,538
Oh non ! Ce sont tes pattes ! Tu es coupable !
Oh no! Those are your paws! You're guilty!

6
00:00:21,838 --> 00:00:25,798
Euh… j'ai toujours faim ! Pardon !
Uh… I'm always hungry! Sorry!

7
00:00:26,098 --> 00:00:30,562
Ha ha ! Le héros a volé le fromage !
Ha ha! The hero stole the cheese!

8
00:00:30,862 --> 00:00:33,526
Je paie tout, c'est promis !
I'll pay for everything, I promise!

